{"name":"Gentle Shadows","hex":"#d6cbba","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"gentle","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Tender and amiable; of a considerate or kindly disposition.","Soft and mild rather than hard or severe."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To become gentle.","To ennoble."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/gentle"},{"term":"shadows","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["plural of shadow"]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["third-person singular simple present indicative of shadow"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/shadows"}],"entries":[{"title":"Gentle (character)","blocks":[{"text":"Gentle is a character appearing in American comic books published by Marvel Comics. Originally from Wakanda, Gentle is a mutant with the ability to increase his muscle mass, giving him immense strength. The character has commonly been depicted as a member of the student body of the Xavier Institute and has also been part of the X-Men."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/5/56/Gentleprofile.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gentle_(character)","wikidata":"Q3760162"},{"title":"Shadow","blocks":[{"text":"A shadow is a dark area on a surface where light from a light source is blocked by an object. In contrast, shade occupies the three-dimensional volume behind an object with light in front of it. The cross-section of a shadow is a two-dimensional silhouette, or a reverse projection of the object blocking the light."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ef/The_shadow_of_a_musician_playing_transverse_flute.jpg/330px-The_shadow_of_a_musician_playing_transverse_flute.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shadow","wikidata":"Q160020"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/a/a3/Gentl